        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "二、伴随矩阵、可逆矩阵"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                341,
                92,
                569,
                112
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "image",
            "content": {
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/38244e486fdea1e092afaad83d766ce790b86f8e93d50452fb1aeb548d9804f2.jpg"
                },
                "image_caption": [],
                "image_footnote": []
            },
            "bbox": [
                11,
                197,
                80,
                313
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "title",
            "content": {
                "title_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "1. 伴随矩阵的概念与公式"
                    }
                ],
                "level": 2
            },
            "bbox": [
                341,
                141,
                576,
                159
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "伴随矩阵：由矩阵A的行列式|A所有的代数余子式所构成的形如"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                302,
                177,
                870,
                217
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "equation_interline",
            "content": {
                "math_content": "\\begin{bmatrix} A_{11} & A_{21} & \\cdots & A_{n1} \\\\ A_{12} & A_{22} & \\cdots & A_{n2} \\\\ \\vdots & \\vdots & & \\vdots \\\\ A_{1n} & A_{2n} & \\cdots & A_{nn} \\end{bmatrix}",
                "math_type": "latex",
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/abbde845eab8f086fb007da8fa947cb7a6bab9b99329fc012110e913bac98a27.jpg"
                }
            },
            "bbox": [
                497,
                222,
                677,
                315
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "的矩阵称为矩阵A的伴随矩阵，记为 "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "A^{*}"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                304,
                321,
                647,
                337
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "例如 "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\mathbf{0}\\boldsymbol{A} = \\begin{bmatrix} 2 & 1 & 2 \\\\ -1 & 0 & 3 \\\\ 1 & -2 & 1 \\end{bmatrix}"
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": ",计算代数余子式，得"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                341,
                344,
                739,
                409
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "equation_interline",
            "content": {
                "math_content": "A_{11} = \\begin{vmatrix} 0 & 3 \\\\ -2 & 1 \\end{vmatrix} = 6, A_{12} = - \\begin{vmatrix} -1 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 1 \\end{vmatrix} = 4,",
                "math_type": "latex",
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/c37bc5146497b2f0219771b3fe4923a34141b6751bbe584889b1a95b826142cc.jpg"
                }
            },
            "bbox": [
                339,
                413,
                721,
                456
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "equation_interline",
            "content": {
                "math_content": "A_{13} = \\begin{vmatrix} -1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & -2 \\end{vmatrix} = 2  ,",
                "math_type": "latex",
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/0514e7ea05764c00a8c46d737696c6718e63b21dbb9943e17f8f1b9dd9c51d70.jpg"
                }
            },
            "bbox": [
                339,
                461,
                546,
                502
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "equation_interline",
            "content": {
                "math_content": "A_{21} = - \\begin{vmatrix} 1 & 2 \\\\ - 2 & 1 \\end{vmatrix} = - 5, A_{22} = \\begin{vmatrix} 2 & 2 \\\\ 1 & 1 \\end{vmatrix} = 0,",
                "math_type": "latex",
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/0ebb63b2a09b94655e55213f59842af0f9a369d26a7c7b5c0160571cabfac80e.jpg"
                }
            },
            "bbox": [
                339,
                506,
                715,
                550
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "equation_interline",
            "content": {
                "math_content": "A_{^{23}} = - \\begin{vmatrix} 2 & 1 \\\\ 1 & - 2 \\end{vmatrix} = 5 ,",
                "math_type": "latex",
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/0d9cfeff2e45936ecc641db9dce7793cc8eaf35f7f5fc8f3fafd73f3e3b9bc28.jpg"
                }
            },
            "bbox": [
                339,
                555,
                539,
                596
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "equation_interline",
            "content": {
                "math_content": "A_{31} = \\begin{vmatrix} 1 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 3 \\end{vmatrix} = 3, A_{32} = - \\begin{vmatrix} 2 & 2 \\\\ -1 & 3 \\end{vmatrix} = - 8,",
                "math_type": "latex",
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/80d4db137ad6a2176820398b8598015d1069cc478bc1af62dbd5ced79e4a4a47.jpg"
                }
            },
            "bbox": [
                339,
                600,
                715,
                643
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "equation_interline",
            "content": {
                "math_content": "A_{33} = \\begin{vmatrix} 2 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0 \\end{vmatrix} = 1  ,",
                "math_type": "latex",
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/ea5fdbadb924e5fedfe90319b579c12fe47ed7dc4fd8f8487070c6ce3e5e7e0f.jpg"
                }
            },
            "bbox": [
                339,
                648,
                526,
                690
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "按定义 "
                    },
                    {
                        "type": "equation_inline",
                        "content": "\\boldsymbol{A}^{*} = \\begin{bmatrix} 6 & -5 & 3 \\\\ 4 & 0 & -8 \\\\ 2 & 5 & 1 \\end{bmatrix}"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                339,
                696,
                594,
                760
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "伴随矩阵的公式："
                    }
                ]
            },
            "bbox": [
                339,
                766,
                489,
                783
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "equation_interline",
            "content": {
                "math_content": "\\boldsymbol{A}\\boldsymbol{A}^{*} = \\boldsymbol{A}^{*} \\boldsymbol{A} = \\left| \\boldsymbol{A} \\right| \\boldsymbol{E}.",
                "math_type": "latex",
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/a28c680553e4b2a5c68c9eead40dff2708af4c245fc2e24ac19d1aa93099e4a2.jpg"
                }
            },
            "bbox": [
                416,
                790,
                620,
                808
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "equation_interline",
            "content": {
                "math_content": "\\left( \\boldsymbol{A}^{*} \\right)^{-1} = \\left( \\boldsymbol{A}^{-1} \\right)^{*} = \\frac{1}{\\left| \\boldsymbol{A} \\right|} \\boldsymbol{A} \\quad \\left( \\left| \\boldsymbol{A} \\right| \\neq 0 \\right).",
                "math_type": "latex",
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/ae2eb6634739531d18e0a537c83e049c0e0eff8ce12d24e794c8022e7570b744.jpg"
                }
            },
            "bbox": [
                416,
                815,
                779,
                847
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "equation_interline",
            "content": {
                "math_content": "(k\\boldsymbol{A})^{*} = k^{n - 1}\\boldsymbol{A}^{*}",
                "math_type": "latex",
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/393cf9d3fc68de29c743664abe89581cf53836c844cec3bd11544692bab9ea4d.jpg"
                }
            },
            "bbox": [
                418,
                853,
                569,
                871
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "equation_interline",
            "content": {
                "math_content": "\\left( \\boldsymbol{A}^{*} \\right)^{\\mathrm{T}} = \\left( \\boldsymbol{A}^{\\mathrm{T}} \\right)^{*}",
                "math_type": "latex",
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/fffa4d5f463c6c6bec57f294df5d6fe939a2fbf85e338e55c5207cfe8702bc47.jpg"
                }
            },
            "bbox": [
                418,
                876,
                569,
                895
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "equation_interline",
            "content": {
                "math_content": "\\left| \\boldsymbol{A}^{*} \\right| = \\left| \\boldsymbol{A} \\right|^{n - 1}",
                "math_type": "latex",
                "image_source": {
                    "path": "images/e6a9b79bf4c036f353f05deb4771b85dc9c85d0b9d5652db5b8b8655e9729cfa.jpg"
                }
            },
            "bbox": [
                418,
                900,
                568,
                919
            ]
        },
        {
